# Credentials. Nothing here is currently tracked; these patterns exist so an
# accidental key file cannot be staged in the first place. The demos read an
# OpenAI key through OPENAI_API_KEY_FILE, which points outside the project.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.netrc
.pypirc
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*_rsa
*_ed25519
credentials.json
service-account*.json
